A vibrant chemistry laboratory scene with a glowing beaker filled with colorful liquid, surrounded by floating molecular structures and a stylized wizard hat perched on top of the beaker. The background is a subtle gradient of deep blue and teal, giving a sense of depth and scientific wonder. The wizard hat is detailed with silver trim and a small crystal at the tip, adding a whimsical touch to the scientific setting. The overall composition should feel energetic and inviting, encouraging users to explore chemistry challenges.
